---
question: Workplace matching gift
---
Ask your employer about their matching gift and workplace giving programs. Some companies will double or even triple your donation, and/or match donations made by spouses, retirees, and board members.&nbsp;

If your company uses a portal for matching gifts, look for the name of Plan C’s fiscal sponsor, NEO Philanthropy. Matching gifts should be designated to NEO Philanthropy “for the benefit of Plan C.”

And you can always send us a note so we can track your gift: {% inlineLink action={discriminant: "mailto", value: "donations@plancpills.org"} _language="" %}donations@plancpills.org{% /inlineLink %}.
